                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="singarx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                jcr:title="AbbVie Westport"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                                langAttribute="none"
                                type="h1"
                                variant="h"/>
                            <text_2033599508
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2026-03-09T14:39:06.637-04:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="singarx"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-03-09T14:40:02.954-04:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="singarx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                langAttribute="none"
                                text="&lt;p>Established in 1977, AbbVie’s Westport facility employs more than 1,400 people and is a centre of excellence for aseptic sterile manufacturing. The campus encompasses a pharmaceuticals facility, two biologics plants and an ocular implant facility that manufactures a range of leading eye care products.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>A €160 million second biologics facility was opened in early 2020. It features a state-of-the-art microbiology and cell-based laboratory with world-class technology and research and development capabilities to support advances in discovery, development and manufacturing.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                            <image_1793817472
                                jcr:created="{Date}2026-03-09T14:39:14.633-04:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="singarx"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-03-09T14:42:30.210-04:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="singarx"
